  {
   "id": "tech",
   "type": "card",
   "say": "Under the hood: EventBridge watches the weather service zone, Step Functions runs the campaign, Amazon Lex understands each answer, and a hundred and twenty lines of tested code decide. Scored on sixty labelled calls: sixty out of sixty, zero unsafe misses.",
   "card": {
    "layout": "flow",
    "title": "Lex understands, code decides",
    "nodes": [
